{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>And it was on the eighth day, Moses called</b> — in gematria this equals היה ביום ראש חדש ניסן (it was on the day of the New Moon of Nisan). Moses said: Because I refused for seven days at the Burning Bush, therefore I did not merit to minister except seven."], :book :leviticus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 9, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:59.252015523Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}